ment\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\">Deathbringer's Assault (Orin)</a> instead.</li>\n<li>Sarevok can immediately strike back at his attacker. If Deathbringer's Legacy is active, he uses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer's Assault\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\">Deathbringer's Assault</a> instead.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Legendary_Action:_Murderous_Retort\">Sources of Legendary Action: Murderous Retort</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Murderous_Retort\" title=\"Legendary Action: Murderous Retort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive